+	depends on PCI_MSI
+	depends on OF
+	select MFD_SYSCON
+	select PCIE_DW_HOST
+	help
+	  Enables support for the GEN2 PCIe root complex of the Samsung
+	  Exynos 9820 SoC, which connects the on-board Broadcom Wi-Fi chip
+	  on the Galaxy S10 series. The PHY setup is done by this driver.
+	  Say Y or M here if you want Wi-Fi on these phones; the module will
